<title>USA: Sbarro sees Q2 EPS at last year's level.</title>
<headline>Sbarro sees Q2 EPS at last year's level.</headline>
<dateline>COMMACK, N.Y. 1997-07-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Restaurant operator Sbarro Inc said on Monday that it expected net earnings for the second quarter to come close to $6.6 million, or $0.33 per share, recorded for same period last year.</p>
<p>In addition, the company warned of a 1 percent reduction in comparable unit sales and a lower-than-anticipated number of new unit openings for the quarter.</p>
<p>Sbarro Inc expects to release second quarter earning during the week of August 11.</p>
</text>
